# Pairs with TwoPartyActivation. Creating a tenant over a registered id hands
# the new incarnation every grant the old one approved.
MODULE: CreateOverExistingTenant
TARGET: TwoPartyActivation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: tenant creation accepts an id that is still registered
PERTURBS: Recreate

--- FIND
    /\ status["B"] = "absent"
--- REPLACE
    /\ status["B"] \in Status
--- END